  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : DéfinitionStructure xdmActorPatient</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder0\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Le nom logique de l'élément\">Nom</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Informations sur l'utilisation de l'élément\">Drapeaux</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Nombre minimum et maximum de fois que l'élément peut apparaître dans l'instance\">Card.</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Référence au type de l'élément\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Informations supplémentaires sur l'élément\">Description et contraintes</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient\" title=\"Cet attribut représente l'acteur Patient.\">xdmActorPatient</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\">XDMActorXDSCore(0.1.0-ballot)</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">XDM ActorPatient<br/><br/>Éléments définis dans les ancêtres :<a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Identifiant de l'acteur qui. Le format de l'identifiant doit respecter le datatype PatId, PSIdNat ou SystIdNat selon le type d'acteur\">xcn1</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Nom d'exercice du professionnel, nom du patient, nom du système.\">xcn2</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Prénom usuel de la personne (par défaut le premier prénom), nom du modèle pour les dispositifs ou dénomination pour les autres systèmes.\">xcn3</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Autorité d’affectation\">xcn9</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Type de nom : 'D' pour les personnes physiques, 'U', pour les systèmes.\">xcn10</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorXdsCore.html\" title=\"Type d’identifiant\">xcn13</a><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Les instances de ce modèle logique peuvent être la cible d'une référence</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Type de donnée primitif\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn1\">xcn1</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn1\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-patId.html\" title=\"string\">PatId(0.1.0-ballot)</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Identifiant du patient. Le matricule INS du patient, tel que défini dans le cadre juridique, est à utiliser prioritairement. À défaut, un autre identifiant (ex : IPP du système émetteur) peut être utilisé.<br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Exemple General: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceDarkGreen\">124018852493334</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn2\">xcn2</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn2\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Nom du patient</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn3\">xcn3</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn3\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Prénom du patient</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn9\">xcn9</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn9\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.xcn9.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn9.composant2\" title=\"Cet identifiant, au format HL7 v.2.5 est constitué de trois sous-composants qui prennent les valeurs suivantes en fonction du type d'identifiant.#xA;INS : Valeur de Namespace ID (IS) = Vide, pas de valeur | Valeur de Universal ID (ST) = OID de l’autorité d’affectation de l’INS utilisé, prise dans la liste des OID des autorités d'affectation des INS | Valeur de Universal ID type (ID) = ISO#xA;Autre identifiant : Valeur de Namespace ID (IS) = Vide, pas de valeur | Valeur de Universal ID (ST) = OID de l’autorité d’affectation dl'identifiant (i.e. l'instituion qui a attribué cet identifiant) | Valeur de Universal ID type (ID) = ISO#xA;\">composant2</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn9.composant2\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Valeur de l'OID de l’autorité d’affectation de l’identifiant. Identifiant de l’autorité d’affectation de l'identifiant utilisé.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn10\">xcn10</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn10\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Type de nom : 'D' pour les personnes physiques, 'U', pour les systèmes.</span><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Motif requis: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceDarkGreen\">D</span> (extensions allowed)</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmActorPatient.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient-definitions.html#xdmActorPatient.xcn13\">xcn13</a><a name=\"xdmActorPatient.xcn13\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/conformance-rules.html#constraints\" title=\"Cet élément a ou est affecté par des contraintes ( TypeIdPatient )\" class=\"xhtConstraintStyle\">C</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">'NH' pour les patients identifiés par leur INS, 'PI' pour les patients identifiés par d'autres identifiants</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Légende pour ce format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation pour ce format</a></td></tr></table></div>"
